&lt;li&gt;eng: prefer Volatile.Read over Thread.VolatileRead by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3457412724" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2960" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2960/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2960"&gt;#2960&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Channel routing: revert normal (non-&lt;code&gt;SSUBSCRIBE&lt;/code&gt;) routing to random, with new &lt;code&gt;WithKeyRouting()&lt;/code&gt; API to opt into routed by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3449666554" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2958" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2958/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2958"&gt;#2958&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
